  "title": "Ex 4.4 · The product of two odd integers",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $x$ and $y$ be integers. Show that if $x$ and $y$ are both odd, then $xy$ is odd.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
